# Root-level line-ending pins. Intentionally NOT a global `text=auto` rule — the
# rest of the tree keeps its current handling; only files that MUST stay LF on
# every platform are pinned here, so they don't break under sh/bash on Windows.
#
# The pre-commit hook has no extension and runs via sh; a CRLF shebang fails with
# "/usr/bin/env sh^M: bad interpreter". Same for shell scripts.
.githooks/* text eol=lf
*.sh        text eol=lf
